{"seq":3,"slug":"options-basics","title":"期权基础","stage":"DONE","category":"personal-finance-investing","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/personal-finance-investing/options-basics","rating":{"composite":3.83,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.48,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 期权基础\n\n期权（Options）是金融衍生品中最精巧的工具之一。它赋予买方在未来特定时间以特定价格买入或卖出标的资产的**权利**（而非义务），这种权利与义务的不对称性是期权区别于期货的核心特征。\n\n## 学习目标\n\n通过本 Hub 的系统学习，你将掌握：\n\n- 期权的基本概念、合约要素与分类体系\n- Black-Scholes 定价模型与希腊字母风险度量\n- 从基础到高级的期权策略组合\n- 中国期权市场的实际交易规则与操作实践\n\n## 内容结构\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n    A[期权基本原理] --> B[定价与希腊字母]\n    B --> C[期权策略]\n    C --> D[中国期权实践]\n\n```\n\n| 章节   | 主题           | 核心内容                             |\n| ------ | -------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 第一章 | 期权基本原理   | Call/Put 定义、合约类型、平价关系    |\n| 第二章 | 定价与希腊字母 | BSM 模型、Greeks、波动率曲面         |\n| 第三章 | 期权策略       | 基础策略、价差策略、高级组合         |\n| 第四章 | 中国期权实践   | 市场概况、保证金结算、个人投资者实操 |\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 基础金融学概念（股票、ETF、期货）\n- 概率论与统计学基础\n- 基本微积分（理解 BSM 推导）\n\n## 适用读者\n\n- 希望系统理解期权原理的投资者\n- 准备参与中国期权市场的个人投资者\n- 需要风险管理工具知识的金融从业者\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"option-fundamentals","title":"期权基本原理","docCount":3,"url":"/h/personal-finance-investing/options-basics/option-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"calls-puts","title":"看涨与看跌期权","url":"/h/personal-finance-investing/options-basics/option-fundamentals/calls-puts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"option-types","title":"期权类型与合约要素","url":"/h/personal-finance-investing/options-basics/option-fundamentals/option-types"},{"seq":3,"slug":"put-call-parity","title":"看跌-看涨平价关系","url":"/h/personal-finance-investing/options-basics/option-fundamentals/put-call-parity"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"pricing-greeks","title":"定价与希腊字母","docCount":3,"url":"/h/personal-finance-investing/options-basics/pricing-greeks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"black-scholes","title":"Black-Scholes 模型","url":"/h/personal-finance-investing/options-basics/pricing-greeks/black-scholes"},{"seq":2,"slug":"greeks-explained","title":"希腊字母详解","url":"/h/personal-finance-investing/options-basics/pricing-greeks/greeks-explained"},{"seq":3,"slug":"volatility-surface","title":"波动率曲面","url":"/h/personal-finance-investing/options-basics/pricing-greeks/volatility-surface"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"strategies","title":"期权策略","docCount":3,"url":"/h/personal-finance-investing/options-basics/strategies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"basic-strategies","title":"基础策略","url":"/h/personal-finance-investing/options-basics/strategies/basic-strategies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"spread-strategies","title":"价差策略","url":"/h/personal-finance-investing/options-basics/strategies/spread-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"advanced-combinations","title":"高级组合","url":"/h/personal-finance-investing/options-basics/strategies/advanced-combinations"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice-china","title":"中国期权实践","docCount":3,"url":"/h/personal-finance-investing/options-basics/practice-china","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"china-options-market","title":"中国期权市场","url":"/h/personal-finance-investing/options-basics/practice-china/china-options-market"},{"seq":2,"slug":"margin-settlement","title":"保证金与结算","url":"/h/personal-finance-investing/options-basics/practice-china/margin-settlement"},{"seq":3,"slug":"retail-practice","title":"个人投资者实操","url":"/h/personal-finance-investing/options-basics/practice-china/retail-practice"}]}]}